  "notes": "Kentucky registers by party. 'Other' here aggregates all non-major-party registrations from the source columns: Other, Independent, Libertarian, Green, Constitution, Reform, Socialist Workers, and Kentucky Party. County FIPS computed from KY's alphabetical county numbering (state FIPS 21 + odd county code 2N-1). Source PDF also breaks out Male/Female and precinct counts, not included here."
